    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Public Tender - Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must let staff quickly access reliable, up-to-date information drawn from the authority's internal procedures, care protocols and HAS recommendations, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents (guides, notes, reference frameworks, drug references)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Considering The client requirements, including the pilot phase followed by progressive rollout, our believe our agile methodology with two-week sprints and demonstrable increments can accommodate this approach." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Considering the budget of €900,000 over 5 years, our available capacity, and our past experience in managing similar projects, it seems feasible to deliver this project within the specified timeframe and budget." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, to ensure compliance with the client's requirements and to provide a more detailed proposal, our would need to conduct a thorough analysis of this project scope, complexity, and specific needs. our consortium partners, such as OuraneCloud for hosting and Ligeo Santé for health-IT integration, can support our in meeting The client technical and regulatory requirements." ;
