        ex:hasText "Our consortium is pleased to submit a proposal for the implementation of an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution for hospital staff at the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB). an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution will provide an intelligent assistance tool accessible from hospital staff work environment, capable of supporting hospital staff in hospital staff clinical and administrative activities. an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution will facilitate access to information, improve the quality of written outputs, and reduce processing and documentation times. an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution will also assist staff in analyzing and handling dossiers by surfacing relevant information, recalling applicable rules, and suggesting actions or verifications. an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution will be designed to fit into existing practices and will not introduce a rupture in clinical or administrative workflows. an artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution will integrate with the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) information system (SIH) and electronic patient record (DPI), ensuring data sovereignty and compliance with regulatory requirements such as GDPR and medical confidentiality." ;
