    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company context, our have a hybrid delivery model combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure suited to public and health procurement. our past references include working with public sector clients, such as a regional council and a mutual health insurer, where our delivered AI assistance solutions within 9 months for one of the projects.  our have a dedicated team available, including a project director, solution architect, engineers, data scientist, and security compliance lead, which can be allocated to this project. our governance practices include a joint steering committee and operational committee, ensuring close collaboration with the client." ;
